msgid "Search using extended syntax"
msgstr "Search using extended syntax"

msgid "The quick search engine allows you to use boolean operators to refine your search. By default, the search applies to all keywords. Searches are not case sensitive."
msgstr "The quick search engine allows you to use boolean operators to refine your search. By default, the search applies to all keywords. Searches are not case sensitive."

msgid "Here is a list of actions you can perform:"
msgstr "Here is a list of actions you can perform:"

msgid "Exact search"
msgstr "Exact search"

msgid "Use quotes to search for an exact keyword or phrase."
msgstr "Use quotes to search for an exact keyword or phrase."

msgid "OR inclusive"
msgstr "OR inclusive"

msgid "Add an OR between words."
msgstr "Add an OR between words."

msgid "Exclude"
msgstr "Exclude"

msgid "Add a dash (-) or NOT before a word to exclude from search. Note that NOT acts as a filtering operator so you cannot have a search containing only NOT operators. You cannot combine OR with NOT (john OR NOT bill is not valid)"
msgstr "Add a dash (-) or NOT before a word to exclude from search. Note that NOT acts as a filtering operator so you cannot have a search containing only NOT operators. You cannot combine OR with NOT (john OR NOT bill is not valid)"

msgid "Grouping"
msgstr "Grouping"

